### Fertilizer recommendation and calculator — sample requests
### Run from Rider / VS / VS Code (REST Client). Get tokens from POST /auth/login first.

@host = http://localhost:5150
@farmerToken = paste-a-buyer-jwt-here
@adminToken = paste-an-admin-jwt-here
@recommendationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ---------- Reference data (anonymous) ----------

### All crops with nutrient data and schedules
GET {{host}}/fertilizer/crops
Accept: application/json

### One crop
GET {{host}}/fertilizer/crops/maize
Accept: application/json

### All fertilizer products
GET {{host}}/fertilizer/products
Accept: application/json

### One product
GET {{host}}/fertilizer/products/npk-15-15-15
Accept: application/json

### ---------- Calculate (anonymous, not saved) ----------

### Simple soil mode, farmer's own products and prices
POST {{host}}/fertilizer/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropId": "maize",
  "area": 0.5,
  "areaUnit": "hectare",
  "soil": { "mode": "simple", "fertility": "medium", "soilType": "loamy", "ph": 5.2 },
  "targetYieldTPerHa": 4.0,
  "fertilizerProductIds": ["npk-15-15-15", "urea"],
  "customPrices": [
    { "productId": "npk-15-15-15", "pricePerBag": 950 },
    { "productId": "urea", "pricePerBag": 900 }
  ]
}

### Soil-test mode, acres, API chooses the products
POST {{host}}/fertilizer/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropId": "cassava",
  "area": 2,
  "areaUnit": "acre",
  "soil": {
    "mode": "soilTest",
    "nitrogenTotalPercent": 0.08,
    "phosphorusBray1MgPerKg": 14,
    "potassiumCmolPerKg": 0.15,
    "ph": 5.1
  }
}

### Plot dimensions (20 m × 15 m), lowland rice
POST {{host}}/fertilizer/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropId": "rice-lowland",
  "areaUnit": "plotDimensions",
  "lengthM": 20,
  "widthM": 15,
  "soil": { "fertility": "low" }
}

### Validation error example → 400 with field-level "errors"
POST {{host}}/fertilizer/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropId": "banana",
  "area": 0,
  "soil": { "mode": "soilTest", "nitrogenTotalPercent": 0.1, "phosphorusBray1MgPerKg": -2, "potassiumCmolPerKg": 0.3 }
}

### ---------- Saved recommendations (signed in) ----------

### Calculate and save
POST {{host}}/fertilizer/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropId": "maize",
  "area": 1,
  "areaUnit": "acre",
  "soil": { "fertility": "low", "soilType": "sandy" },
  "plotLabel": "Back field by the stream"
}

### My history (filters are optional)
GET {{host}}/fertilizer/recommendations?cropId=maize&plotLabel=Back%20field%20by%20the%20stream&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### One saved recommendation
GET {{host}}/fertilizer/recommendations/{{recommendationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Delete it
DELETE {{host}}/fertilizer/recommendations/{{recommendationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Admin: all farmers' history, or one farmer's
GET {{host}}/fertilizer/recommendations?userId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------- Reference data maintenance (admin) ----------

### Set a product price (PUT replaces all fields — send the full product)
PUT {{host}}/fertilizer/products/urea
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Urea (46-0-0)",
  "type": "straight",
  "nitrogenPercent": 46,
  "phosphatePercent": 0,
  "potashPercent": 0,
  "bagSizeKg": 50,
  "pricePerBag": 900,
  "notes": "Most concentrated N source. Cover with soil after applying."
}

### Add a product
POST {{host}}/fertilizer/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "npk-17-17-17",
  "name": "NPK 17-17-17",
  "type": "compound",
  "nitrogenPercent": 17,
  "phosphatePercent": 17,
  "potashPercent": 17,
  "bagSizeKg": 50,
  "pricePerBag": 1000
}

### Update a crop's nutrient data (schedule percentages per nutrient must total 100)
PUT {{host}}/fertilizer/crops/maize
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maize",
  "localName": "Kon",
  "nitrogenKgPerHa": 90,
  "phosphateKgPerHa": 45,
  "potashKgPerHa": 45,
  "referenceYieldTPerHa": 3.5,
  "maxRealisticYieldTPerHa": 7.0,
  "yieldBasis": "dry grain",
  "plantsPerHectare": 53333,
  "isPerennial": false,
  "schedule": [
    { "stage": "Basal (at planting)", "daysAfterPlanting": 0, "timing": "At planting", "nitrogenPercent": 40, "phosphatePercent": 100, "potashPercent": 100 },
    { "stage": "Top-dressing", "daysAfterPlanting": 35, "timing": "4-6 weeks after planting", "nitrogenPercent": 60, "phosphatePercent": 0, "potashPercent": 0 }
  ]
}

### Add a crop
POST {{host}}/fertilizer/crops
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "cowpea",
  "name": "Cowpea",
  "nitrogenKgPerHa": 20,
  "phosphateKgPerHa": 40,
  "potashKgPerHa": 20,
  "referenceYieldTPerHa": 1.0,
  "maxRealisticYieldTPerHa": 2.5,
  "yieldBasis": "dry grain",
  "isPerennial": false,
  "schedule": [
    { "stage": "Basal (at planting)", "daysAfterPlanting": 0, "timing": "At planting", "nitrogenPercent": 100, "phosphatePercent": 100, "potashPercent": 100 }
  ]
}
